---
description: Prisma rules
globs:
  - "prisma/**/*"
  - "src/prisma/**/*.ts"
  - "src/modules/**/*.service.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Prisma

Use postgresql and Prisma migrations.

Define models in `prisma/schema.prisma`.
Use one shared `PrismaService` from `src/prisma/`.
Never instantiate `PrismaClient` inside domain services.

Prefer `String @id @default(cuid())` IDs.
Use `createdAt` and `updatedAt` where useful.
Seed data belongs to Prisma seed files.
